  "claims": [
    "The fitting gives the equilibrium constant of adsorption and the sticking coefficient.",
    "The simulations predict the experimental measurement results quite well for Al2O3 and TiO2 ALD processes.",
    "The model presented here describes quite well the thickness distribution of ALD growth in narrow channels.",
    "This model can be used to design and optimize a deposition process for a new device.",
    "The penetration depth does not depend on the length of the channel when it is long enough.",
    "There are no concentration gradients in the y-direction in the millisecond time scale of the ALD process.",
    "In the last case (H=0.2 µm), the channel entrance is completely plugged up.",
    "Although the Gordon model in this case gives a good description of the film penetration depth, it does not give the thickness profile and it does not enable modeling of the film growth kinetics."
